  "question": {
    "text": "The rear side of a truck is open and a box of mass <math><mn>2</mn><mn>&nbsp;k</mn><mn>g</mn></math> is placed on the truck <math><mn>8</mn><mn>&nbsp;m</mn></math> away from the open end. The truck starts from rest with an acceleration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mn>&nbsp;m</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mn>s</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> on a straight road. The box will fall off the truck when it is at distance from the starting point equal to (in meter)<br />\r<br />\r(Given, <math><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mn>&nbsp;m</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mn>s</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> ).",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "16",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>a</mi></math> be the acceleration of truck,<br /><br /><img height=\"88\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/jhjsvnjknyvzqsbrtjmsyaredjogdvcklqgxfbulbdrifdzmfl.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" width=\"268\" /><br /><br />For block,<br /><br /><img height=\"87\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/wtteaqdgpamjqjisgudlonfjciidaaceiehevbdyiatqjqploq.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" width=\"163\" /><br /><br /><math><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi>g</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mrow><mn>&nbsp;m</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>s</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mn>&nbsp;s</mn></math><br /><br />The block will fall off the truck after <math><mn>4</mn><mn>&nbsp;s</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />For truck,<br /><br />Distance travelled by the truck in this time.<br /><br /><math><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>&nbsp;m</mn></math>",
